    "long_instructions": "#### Change an interactive part\r\n\r\n1. Pick one interactive part of your page, like a button, and name it.\r\n2. Ask the AI for a change. Say what a visitor does and what happens.\r\n3. Try it out. If it's not what you wanted, tell the AI what to fix.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Make the Sign Up button show a thank-you message when a visitor clicks it.”*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it name the part, what the visitor does, and what happens?",
